    {
      "displayText": "Hey there! Think you could help a guy out?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSee, I started up a Gogoat carrier service, but all\nmy helpers are on the small side for Gogoat.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What I really need is a big ol’ Gogoat that could\ncarry larger packages for my clients.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Could you be a pal and catch an extra-large\nGogoat for me?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIf you want to know the size of a Pokémon, just\ncheck its summary! Should be right there!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
